{"id": "Dfc59rPsETD", "title": "Video by kallawaymarketing", "description": "Here’s how to write a hook so good it’s basically unskippable.\n\nThis is called “The Desire Hook” method.\n\nAnd if you do this right, it will turn viewers into buyers at a crazy rate.\n\nStep 1 is to lead with a desired outcome.\n\nMost hooks tease secret information.\n\nBut if you really want to lock someone in, you gotta start by referencing an outcome they secretly want.\n\nFor example…\n\nAn info hook is something like this, “Here are the 3 best algorithm hacks for Instagram”\n\nThis will get views, but only from low quality viewers that will likely never buy.\n\nInstead, a desire hook is something like this, “Here’s how to go from 200 followers to 20,000 in the next 6 weeks.\n\nThe outcome you want is follower growth\n\nAnd the direct signaling to it makes you lean in more.\n\nNow step 2 is to tie that outcome to a relatable character.\n\nThis can be you, the viewer, a third party…but whichever you choose, connecting the outcome to a character makes it so much more real.\n\nIf I say…\n\n“Here’s how Tony went from 200 to 20,000 followers in the last 6 weeks using a simple 3 step framework”\n\nNot only is that compelling…but if the framework is nonobvious, many people will want to buy that solution.\n\nI’m telling you Desire Hooking is the cheat for attracting premium quality viewers.\n\nNow there are 5 hook templates you can use to package the outcome + character combo to make this work.\n\nComment “desire” and I’ll send through a full video breaking all 5 of them down, with real examples and the exact hook formula that you can use today.\n\nFollow @kallawaymarkerting to learn how to grow faster on social media\n\nComment “22” to work with me 1:1 to scale your personal brand faster (limited spots)\n\n#marketing  #socialmedia #contentstrategy #contentcreator #video", "channel": "kallawaymarketing", "uploader_id": "67218622229", "uploader": "Kallaway", "timestamp": 1794078847, "like_cou